{"3712750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RoboSouls", "steam_appid": 3712750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RoboSouls 是一款 FPS 多人、机器人载具驾驶对战游戏。操作手通过密切团队配合、实时竞技。为您提供拟真的机甲大师线上对战体验。</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/23221d0c19858079d8bd063aecc6a911.poster.avif?t=1749435780\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/23221d0c19858079d8bd063aecc6a911.webm?t=1749435780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/23221d0c19858079d8bd063aecc6a911.mp4?t=1749435780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >机甲大师，畅快对战</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >操控多种步兵机器人发射 17mm 小弹丸，在自动瞄准的加持下，畅快突击，撕裂防线</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/e835099001d4c1de2c4b7717a3bde26a.avif?t=1749435780\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras_big/e835099001d4c1de2c4b7717a3bde26a.avif?t=1749435780 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >操控多种英雄机器人发射 42mm 大弹丸，攻城略地，先拔前哨，爆种基地。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/417c8fa94f345fbee79ee6b210f7a37d.avif?t=1749435780\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras_big/417c8fa94f345fbee79ee6b210f7a37d.avif?t=1749435780 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >操控多种工程机器人抓取并兑换矿石，经济奠定胜局。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/4e3eed33d01b7fbf93ca01a3bb5d5e32.avif?t=1749435780\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras_big/4e3eed33d01b7fbf93ca01a3bb5d5e32.avif?t=1749435780 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/47b2c3b7a53401074628d55e1bcb9896.avif?t=1749435780\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras_big/47b2c3b7a53401074628d55e1bcb9896.avif?t=1749435780 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >操控多种无人机近距支援，掌控全局。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/fb8368b8256cfb200178744b614fbfa1.avif?t=1749435780\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras_big/fb8368b8256cfb200178744b614fbfa1.avif?t=1749435780 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >利用多种飞镖系统，战术打击，密切配合。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/9f286c79de0171590f40d6e9ae0cd170.avif?t=1749435780\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras_big/9f286c79de0171590f40d6e9ae0cd170.avif?t=1749435780 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >利用多种全自动哨兵机器人，人机合一，合砍胜局。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >多种规则，多种地图</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RoboSouls 将持续更新规则体系，支持多种规则体系地图对抗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——向您介绍「古战场计划」，记忆犹新的 2019 赛季，将在 RoboSouls 中与您见面。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >社交战队，必胜我队</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在 RoboSouls 中绑定您的 RoboSouls ID，创建并加入您的线上战队。面对看似不可能的任务，拉上可以交出后背的队友，组建无所不能的超级阵容，让不可能成为可能。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >战术分析，所向披靡</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在 RoboSouls 独创机甲战场导播视角中，在 RoboSouls 回放系统中，复盘您的每一次操作。在汗水中铸就钢铁的纪律。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >数据统计，日拱一卒</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在 RoboSouls 在线数据统计中查看您的过往战绩，与所有机甲小子同屏竞技。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RoboSouls 是一款 FPS 多人、机器人载具驾驶对战游戏。操作手通过密切团队配合、实时竞技。为您提供拟真的机甲大师线上对战体验。</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/23221d0c19858079d8bd063aecc6a911.poster.avif?t=1749435780\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/23221d0c19858079d8bd063aecc6a911.webm?t=1749435780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/23221d0c19858079d8bd063aecc6a911.mp4?t=1749435780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >机甲大师，畅快对战</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >操控多种步兵机器人发射 17mm 小弹丸，在自动瞄准的加持下，畅快突击，撕裂防线</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712750/extras/e835099001d4c1de2c4b7717a3bde26a.avif?t=1749435780\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.stea